        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions LGN150FBR, 1-1/2\" Diameter Offset Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1-1/2\" Diameter Offset Wood Door Pull is available in <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\" target=\"new\">your choice of wood</a>. Choose from cherry, mahogany, white oak, and black walnut. The Lewis Offset Wood Door Pull is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. The offset brackets are made from brass and available in an array of finishes to coordinate not only with the wood selection, but also with your home's style. This door handle can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to back mounted. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n<br>\r\nAlso available <a href=\"/products/offset-teak-door-pull-first-impressions-lgn150tekfbr\"><b>Teak Offset Wood Door Pull</b></a> and other style <a href=\"/collections/wood-door-pulls\"><b>Wood Door Pulls</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Lewis 01 Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-LWS01-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262249\"><b>First Impressions LGN150FBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LGN150018FBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Offset: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LGN150024FBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Offset: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LGN150036FBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Offset: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Different Wood Types</b> and <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Offset Wood Door Pull",
                "description": "The 1-1/2 inch Diameter Offset Wood Door Pull is available in your choice of wood. Choose from cherry, bubinga, jatoba, mahogany, white oak, and black walnut. The Lewis Offset Wood Door Pull is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. The offset brackets are made from brass and available in an array of finishes to coordinate not only with the wood selection, but also with your home's style. This door handle can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to back mounted. \r\n",
                "keywords": "FII-10W-OF Offset Door Pulls, offset Door Pulls, First Impressions 10W-OF Wood Door Pulls, wooden door pulls Commercial doors,  first impressions Wood Offset Commercial Door Pulls, offset door handles, First Impressions door pulls, Offset Wood Door Pulls, wooden door handles, Offset Wood Door Pulls, 1-1/2 Diameter Offset Wood Door Pulls, Lewis Offset Wood Door Pulls, First Impressions LWS01, FII-LWS01, FII-LWS01018, FII-LWS01024, FII-LWS01036, First Impressions Lewis 01 Wood Door Handles,  FII-LGN150FBR, First Impressions LGN150FBR, LAGUNA 150 -Door Pull 1-1/2 Solid Round Wood Grip Offset With Bevel Mounts In Brass,"
